0..76 Comment "// A Tarski universe closed under dependent pairs, with the decoder arm that"
77..94 Comment "// stays refused."
95..97 Comment "//"
98..176 Comment "// Martin-Löf\'s universe is closed under dependent functions, dependent pairs"
177..252 Comment "// and identity types. Each such code decodes to a family at the decodes of"
253..312 Comment "// its fields. A decode thus stands as a family\'s argument."
313..315 Comment "//"
316..390 Comment "// A run binds a decode as a type of its own. A field at the code\'s decode"
391..420 Comment "// then stands apart from it."
421..423 Comment "//"
424..498 Comment "// - see: `model/universe/pair-and-path-codes.gandr` — the pair and path"
499..547 Comment "//   codes with their decodes in place, admitted"
548..618 Comment "// - see: Martin-Löf, _Intuitionistic Type Theory_, Bibliopolis, 1984"
620..636 Comment "// The naturals."
